WEBVTT

00:00:59.618 --> 00:01:00.936
every single day,

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:06.183
knowing that the most precious aspects
of our lives are in good hands.

00:01:07.239 --> 00:01:09.318
But we don't think about it that way.

00:01:10.026 --> 00:01:13.547
It's almost defined by its invisibility.

00:01:14.483 --> 00:01:16.166
You could go into any neighborhood

00:01:16.190 --> 00:01:19.362
and not know which homes
are also workplaces.

00:01:19.386 --> 00:01:20.958
There's no sign.

00:01:20.982 --> 00:01:23.902
There's no list or registry.

00:01:23.926 --> 00:01:25.466
It's just invisible.

00:01:27.791 --> 00:01:33.774
And it's this work that is not even
referred to as real work.